OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FTurning
OL,6,Fcloudy with outbreaks of rain
OL,7,Fspreading east through the evening and
OL,8,Fovernight, rain heavy at times. Mainly
OL,9,Fdry by morning with just the odd
OL,10,Fshower and some clear spells.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FBright spells and some
OL,13,Fshowers through the day, the odd one
OL,14,Fturning heavy in the afternoon. Best
OL,15,Fof the dry, bright weather in the
OL,16,Fsoutheast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
